Description: lld for LLVM 19 / Clang 19
 Provides lld, ld64.lld and ld.lld under /var/jb/usr/lib/llvm-19 plus
 versioned PATH links (lld-19, ld64.lld-19). Includes post-link ldid
 signing after Mach-O write.
